@startuml
' How the Manager GUI enumerates a service's methods with no .proto file:
' Consul resolves the address, gRPC reflection supplies the descriptors.
' Rendered into docs/architecture/overview.md.

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #7A7A7A
  LifeLineBorderColor #B0B0B0
  ArrowColor #3C3C3C
}

title Method discovery via gRPC server reflection

autonumber

participant "Manager GUI"     as GUI
participant "FastAPI bridge"  as Bridge
participant "Consul agent"    as Consul
participant "Service"         as Svc

GUI    -> Bridge : GET /api/grpc/services/<name>
Bridge -> Consul : lookup <name> (HTTP)
Consul --> Bridge : host : port
Bridge -> Svc    : gRPC reflection\n(ServerReflectionInfo)
Svc    --> Bridge : file descriptors\n(services, methods, message schemas)
Bridge --> GUI   : methods + schemas (JSON)

@enduml
